<title>ITALY: Italy's Autostrade privatisation seen by end-July.</title>
<headline>Italy's Autostrade privatisation seen by end-July.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The privatisation of Italian state motorway operator Autostrade could take place by the end of July, Public Works junior minister Antonio Bargone said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bargone said the outline privatisation plan was ready.</p>
<p>&quot;The Public Works ministry has completed very rapidly its part in the task and has made everything ready for the privatisation to take place substantially within the summer, before the end of July,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +39 6 678 2501</p>
</text>
